# SPA fallback.
#
# Routes live in the path (/kanata/pokemon/bidoof), and none of those paths
# exist as files. Cloudflare Pages serves a real file when one matches and
# falls through to this rule otherwise, so assets are unaffected and a deep
# link opened cold still boots the app.
#
# The service worker's navigateFallback does the same job once it is installed.
# This is what covers the first visit, before there is a worker.
/*  /index.html  200
